      "writtenOn": "2021-09-27T13:50:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`vm` is part of the developer toolkit and therefore I think it\u0027s desirable to provide a way to override the config value without requiring developers to change the config file (followed by building and installing the app having the config). \n\nHaving arch-specific config is possible, but then we will have lots of duplication between the copies.",
      "parentUuid": "eac0436c_34471c76",
      "revId": "1512fae7d3f292edcfd501e37edc57823f804c8a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
